# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile is the repository root (docker-compose.yml: context ..).
# The image needs packages/ only. Never send runtime data, secrets or local tool state:
# without this file the image baked in the development database and log signing seed.
**/data
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
# Local tool caches and build output: untracked, so an image built from a working checkout would otherwise differ
# from one built from a clean worktree of the same commit (docs/evidence names an image by its ID).
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
.git
# Secrets and databases, wherever they sit.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.seed
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.DS_Store
